1. TestRenewHeartbeatUpdatesOnlyTimestamp
2. TestRenewHeartbeatAcceptsUnixSeconds
3. TestRenewHeartbeatRejectsBadInput (missing/unparseable heartbeat_at → 400, nothing changes; unknown instance → 404)
4. TestBatchRenewHeartbeatsUpdatesInRequestOrder
